      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "For COVID-19 mortality, subgroup analysis was conducted according to baseline score on the National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases (NIAID) ordinal scale.",
      "reason": "The evidence specifies at least one set of groups used for synthesis (subgroups for mortality by baseline NIAID ordinal score). However, it does not clearly specify how all groups used in each synthesis are defined/structured and linked to the review objective comparisons (beyond this subgrouping information)."
    },
